      "key_point": "S12.K4",
      "question": "When a language model is paired with an external knowledge base, what primary benefit does this separation provide?",
      "answer": "It allows the model to perform fact lookup from a reliable, external source. This helps ensure that the generated information is grounded in verifiable data, rather than just being a probabilistic prediction."
